  - 'The panel''s convergence held under implementation: the MCP layer came out ~300 lines because everything load-bearing (refusals, sequencing ladders, state-aware status, descriptors) landed engine/daemon-side where all three skins inherit it — the ''thin skin'' prediction was structural, not aesthetic.'
